WEBVTT

01:36.720 --> 01:39.970
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.110 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 20]

01:44.110 --> 01:45.110
Dad.

01:46.710 --> 01:48.070
About Siyi repeating a year,

01:48.110 --> 01:49.110
I've been thinking,

01:50.259 --> 01:51.320
our family will cover

01:51.870 --> 01:52.630
the tuition fees.

01:54.070 --> 01:55.420
Let's not have the other families pay.

01:55.670 --> 01:56.229
What do you think?

01:57.350 --> 01:58.710
Money is not a problem.

01:59.450 --> 02:00.680
The key is her mentality.

02:01.390 --> 02:02.470
Siyi takes things to heart.

02:03.790 --> 02:06.470
It's hard to say if she'll agree to repeat a year.

02:08.789 --> 02:10.789
If she doesn't repeat, what will she do?

02:11.790 --> 02:12.940
She can't just waste time, can she?

02:13.310 --> 02:14.590
Kindness can turn into resentment.

02:16.590 --> 02:18.910
We also have to take into account the kid's psychological endurance,

02:19.550 --> 02:20.190
don't we?

02:22.440 --> 02:23.560
Raising one daughter

02:23.600 --> 02:24.960
or two, there's no big difference.

02:25.220 --> 02:27.790
At worst, we'll tighten our belts for two years.

02:27.850 --> 02:30.579
We have to support Siyi through university no matter what,

02:30.829 --> 02:31.560
right?

02:32.870 --> 02:34.460
Even Fenghua isn't going to university.

02:34.550 --> 02:36.620
You want to support Gu Siyi through university? Are you doing too well yourself?

02:37.420 --> 02:39.480
Well, Fenghua isn't going to university

02:39.510 --> 02:40.740
because she can't get in.

02:40.740 --> 02:42.110
If she could get in,

02:42.150 --> 02:43.760
I'd sell my blood to support her if I had to.

02:44.350 --> 02:45.430
That goes without saying.

02:46.020 --> 02:47.550
If Siyi doesn't want to go to university,

02:47.550 --> 02:48.480
then let her be.

02:48.500 --> 02:51.770
She can open a small shop with Fenghua in the future

02:52.270 --> 02:53.030
and do some small business.

02:53.079 --> 02:54.550
They can split the profits evenly.

02:54.670 --> 02:56.350
In a couple of years, if she's getting married,

02:56.470 --> 02:57.710
we'll scrimp and save

02:57.710 --> 02:58.870
to prepare her dowry.

02:58.870 --> 03:00.470
That would be enough as a neighbor, right?

03:01.220 --> 03:02.740
No matter how much we want to help Siyi,

03:03.070 --> 03:05.270
you still have to consider Fenghua's feelings.

03:36.950 --> 03:38.150
Siwei.

03:38.150 --> 03:39.670
Your sister is back.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.400
Siyi.

03:45.350 --> 03:46.130
Siyi.

03:48.030 --> 03:48.550
Have some candy.

03:50.530 --> 03:52.260
I just licked it.

03:52.910 --> 03:54.100
Ge Siwei!

03:55.030 --> 03:56.350
Aren't you disgusting?

03:56.350 --> 03:57.120
Alright. Stop it.

03:57.150 --> 03:58.860
Grandma, look at her.

03:58.860 --> 04:00.180
Alright, alright.

04:00.230 --> 04:01.670
Grandma will protect you.

04:01.670 --> 04:04.500
You're a big boy now, still being bullied by girls?

04:09.200 --> 04:10.390
When our Siwei

04:10.390 --> 04:13.430
grows up tall in the future,

04:13.550 --> 04:15.550
he'll protect his sister well, won't he?

04:15.790 --> 04:16.550
Yes.

04:16.880 --> 04:17.750
When I grow up,

04:17.750 --> 04:19.170
I'll protect Siyi.

06:54.340 --> 06:57.330
♫Far away, so far away♫

06:58.500 --> 07:01.770
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

07:03.220 --> 07:05.840
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

07:06.430 --> 07:11.110
♫Listening to the river flow♫

07:17.230 --> 07:20.790
Dear uncles, aunts, and Grandpa Zhou.

07:17.630 --> 07:20.570
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

07:21.080 --> 07:22.490
I've left.

07:21.530 --> 07:25.080
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

07:22.510 --> 07:24.350
I'm sorry I couldn't say goodbye

07:24.380 --> 07:25.700
to you all in person.

07:25.850 --> 07:28.030
I just couldn't muster the courage.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.630
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

07:29.210 --> 07:30.800
I came here when I was ten,

07:29.500 --> 07:33.820
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

07:31.050 --> 07:32.640
and I'm leaving at 18.

07:32.870 --> 07:35.000
These short eight years have been

07:35.030 --> 07:36.510
the happiest time of my life.

07:37.460 --> 07:38.980
I'll always remember the kindness

07:39.580 --> 07:40.760
you showed me in the past.

07:41.790 --> 07:44.580
I hope you all stay healthy and happy in the future,

07:45.050 --> 07:46.300
just like in the past,

07:46.350 --> 07:48.909
with your hearts filled with sunshine and infinite warmth.

07:49.220 --> 07:53.010
[Wanghe] [Fenghua] [Haikuo] [Xingchi]

07:49.670 --> 07:51.550
These insoles were handmade by Grandma

07:52.070 --> 07:53.590
as a high school graduation gift for you.

07:54.510 --> 07:55.470
She didn't have the chance

07:55.960 --> 07:57.520
to give them to you.

07:59.570 --> 08:01.860
A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.

08:02.600 --> 08:03.600
On behalf of Grandma,

08:03.870 --> 08:05.840
I wish every step you take in the future

08:05.980 --> 08:08.400
to be steady and firm.

08:07.260 --> 08:09.470
[Xingchi]

08:09.550 --> 08:10.480
Farewell,

08:10.870 --> 08:12.580
this miraculous courtyard.

08:13.590 --> 08:14.550
Farewell,

08:15.130 --> 08:17.380
the kindest family in the world to me.

08:18.120 --> 08:20.250
[Station 1
Honghuai to Chengdu]

08:21.620 --> 08:22.430
Siyi!

08:24.230 --> 08:24.940
[Honghuai to Chengdu]

08:26.150 --> 08:27.600
[Station 1
Honghuai to Chengdu]

08:27.670 --> 08:29.850
[Jixiang Passanger Transport Co., Ltd.]

08:33.440 --> 08:34.150
Siyi!

08:34.179 --> 08:35.059
Ma Siyi!

08:35.750 --> 08:36.110
Siyi!

08:36.110 --> 08:36.510
Ma Siyi!

08:36.510 --> 08:36.789
Get off!

08:36.789 --> 08:37.270
Siyi!

08:37.789 --> 08:38.480
Siyi!

08:38.630 --> 08:40.070
Ma Siyi, get off!

08:40.130 --> 08:42.120
Siyi, get off already!

08:42.150 --> 08:43.010
Siyi!

08:48.790 --> 08:49.590
Siyi!

08:51.730 --> 08:52.610
Siyi!

08:53.950 --> 08:54.950
Ma Siyi!

08:57.430 --> 08:58.090
Siyi!

08:58.190 --> 08:59.070
Siyi!

09:00.750 --> 09:01.800
Siyi!

09:02.240 --> 09:04.140
-Siyi!
-Siyi!

09:04.750 --> 09:05.550
Siyi!

09:08.380 --> 09:09.200
Siyi!

09:09.550 --> 09:10.410
Siyi!

09:11.230 --> 09:12.000
Siyi!

09:12.550 --> 09:13.520
Siyi!

09:29.950 --> 09:31.470
Siyi was gone,

09:32.390 --> 09:34.650
and our youth was over.

09:35.820 --> 09:37.850
The summer we graduated from 12th grade

09:38.150 --> 09:39.270
felt incredibly long.

09:39.800 --> 09:41.980
On countless difficult summer nights,

09:42.040 --> 09:43.430
we learned how to force a smile

09:43.430 --> 09:45.870
all by ourselves.

09:48.790 --> 09:51.630
♫Stepping on the old time♫

09:52.330 --> 09:55.690
♫The wind blows gently♫

09:56.540 --> 10:01.040
♫Blowing through the forest and the city♫

09:59.720 --> 10:00.350
I dare you to push me again.

10:00.350 --> 10:02.130
Girls, show your ears.

10:00.530 --> 10:07.100
[Group Photo of the 2008 Graduating Class of Honghuai No. 7 High School]

10:02.230 --> 10:03.670
Come on, time for graduation photos.

10:02.250 --> 10:05.090
♫Blowing through your face♫

10:03.670 --> 10:05.150
Everyone, cheer up.

10:05.190 --> 10:06.550
-Got it!
-Good.

10:06.460 --> 10:09.300
♫And my heart♫

10:06.550 --> 10:07.270
Come on.

10:07.630 --> 10:08.710
Come on, students.

10:08.920 --> 10:09.710
Look at the camera, come on.

10:09.710 --> 10:10.270
One.

10:10.310 --> 10:10.830
Two.

10:10.390 --> 10:12.780
♫The wind blows gently♫

10:10.740 --> 10:14.640
[Group Photo of the 2008 Graduating Class of Honghuai No. 7 High School]

10:10.830 --> 10:11.350
Three.

10:11.390 --> 10:13.510
Cheese!

10:13.790 --> 10:14.470
Good.

10:13.980 --> 10:16.250
♫Blowing through summer♫

10:14.610 --> 10:15.040
Alright.

10:15.080 --> 10:15.870
The second one, come on.

10:15.870 --> 10:16.270
Cheer up.

10:16.350 --> 10:17.140
Alright, get ready.

10:16.960 --> 10:19.490
♫Blowing through the eaves♫

10:17.310 --> 10:17.970
Three.

10:18.110 --> 10:18.720
Two.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.390
One.

10:19.670 --> 10:22.270
Cheese!

10:20.520 --> 10:22.720
♫It blows past me♫

10:23.410 --> 10:26.950
♫Warm love♫

10:24.730 --> 10:30.610
[IOU]

10:28.150 --> 10:29.680
♫How many years♫

10:28.270 --> 10:29.830
A relationship

10:30.030 --> 10:31.350
ended

10:30.750 --> 10:33.860
♫Have you changed?♫

10:31.590 --> 10:32.990
before it even started.

10:35.140 --> 10:36.470
♫How many years♫

10:37.320 --> 10:40.630
♫How far has the old times♫

10:40.070 --> 10:41.620
A sunken ship

10:41.650 --> 10:43.310
which had undergone the passage of time

10:41.940 --> 10:43.730
♫We miss gone♫

10:43.330 --> 10:44.470
was reborn.

10:44.470 --> 10:45.900
There really is a ship!

10:44.590 --> 10:48.130
♫I was lost in a distance♫

10:46.990 --> 10:48.150
Move back a bit.

10:49.630 --> 10:50.950
At every gathering,

10:49.800 --> 10:51.490
♫I couldn't forget♫

10:51.310 --> 10:52.740
we'd turn around,

10:52.120 --> 10:56.050
♫The first growth♫

10:52.790 --> 10:55.410
hoping there were still people in that room

10:55.510 --> 10:58.260
and we could still hear their laughter.

11:00.450 --> 11:01.550
After Siyi left,

11:01.550 --> 11:03.120
we could never get in touch with her again.

11:03.420 --> 11:05.230
Sometimes, we also wonder

11:05.420 --> 11:07.990
if this person really existed in our lives.

11:08.230 --> 11:09.700
Are you watching TV?

11:10.080 --> 11:11.480
I miss you.

11:10.890 --> 11:12.480
♫That's me♫

11:13.520 --> 11:18.630
♫Thinking of you deeply♫

11:15.400 --> 11:16.920
Take care of yourself.

11:16.950 --> 11:18.170
See you in Beijing.

11:19.520 --> 11:21.260
... Cheer for peace,

11:21.350 --> 11:22.860
and play the most beautiful music

11:23.110 --> 11:26.570
for the Olympic spirit.

11:33.110 --> 11:35.250
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

11:35.910 --> 11:38.560
♫Open up the world for you♫

11:39.080 --> 11:44.950
♫The charm in the flow is full of vitality♫

11:45.370 --> 11:47.380
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

11:47.630 --> 11:49.890
Just like what we dreamed of when we were young,

11:48.180 --> 11:50.680
♫Breathe together under the sun♫

11:49.990 --> 11:51.990
we came to Beijing one after another.

11:51.300 --> 11:57.210
♫Achieve new things on this yellow land♫

11:53.870 --> 11:55.650
Wanghe got into Renmin University of China

11:55.680 --> 11:57.260
and majored in economics.

11:57.450 --> 11:58.800
He became a top student

11:58.870 --> 12:00.620
in the class as everyone expected.

12:00.470 --> 12:02.730
[Welcome New Students]

12:02.270 --> 12:03.990
Haikuo got into Beijing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics

12:04.070 --> 12:05.490
and majored in computer science.

12:06.000 --> 12:07.510
He met his first love

12:07.510 --> 12:08.980
on the first day of university.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.190
In order to keep his promise to Siyi,

12:12.350 --> 12:14.140
Chen Rui disregarded his family's objections

12:12.410 --> 12:15.490
[Honghuai Normal University]

12:14.170 --> 12:15.700
and got into the archaeology department

12:15.720 --> 12:16.910
of Honghuai Normal University.

12:17.010 --> 12:19.780
♫My door is always open♫

12:19.950 --> 12:22.510
♫Accepting the world♫

12:20.260 --> 12:21.360
Hello.

12:22.430 --> 12:23.830
At the end of summer in Beijing,

12:23.340 --> 12:25.480
♫Time blooms and youth smiles♫

12:24.160 --> 12:27.260
there are countless students full of expectations for the future.

12:26.020 --> 12:28.410
♫Welcoming this day♫

12:26.900 --> 12:28.110
[Zhongguancun South Road]

12:27.820 --> 12:29.760
There are also dream pursuers who are just taking one step at a time

12:29.390 --> 12:31.650
♫We're all friends♫

12:29.780 --> 12:31.870
like Xingchi and me.

12:32.250 --> 12:34.830
♫Please don't be shy♫

12:35.080 --> 12:37.590
♫A bright smile♫

12:37.470 --> 12:38.210
Fenghua!

12:38.380 --> 12:39.920
♫Waiting for you♫

12:40.410 --> 12:42.420
Oh my god, why are you here?

12:40.590 --> 12:42.560
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

12:43.370 --> 12:45.680
♫Touching you like music♫

12:44.700 --> 12:45.990
When we were home,

12:46.020 --> 12:47.920
we always found our parents annoying

12:46.400 --> 12:52.100
♫Let's try our best to surpass ourselves♫

12:48.270 --> 12:50.010
and wanted to grow up quickly

12:50.080 --> 12:51.140
so that we could live alone.

12:51.310 --> 12:52.900
[Housekeeping]

12:51.610 --> 12:52.990
Only after we went to Beijing

12:52.680 --> 12:54.790
♫Welcome to Beijing♫

12:53.250 --> 12:54.800
did we start to miss home

12:54.830 --> 12:57.220
and realize how happy we were as kids

12:55.740 --> 12:58.120
♫Anyone who has dreams is amazing♫

12:57.240 --> 12:59.850
with our parents' protection.

12:59.300 --> 13:04.660
♫There will be miracles if you have courage♫

13:00.140 --> 13:01.730
[A ship from Qing Dynasty: Dragon Boat]

13:01.760 --> 13:02.880
[]

13:04.000 --> 13:05.640
The sunken boat

13:05.700 --> 13:07.790
salvaged a kilometer south of the Flower Street

13:08.450 --> 13:10.450
carries the hidden history of our courtyard

13:10.850 --> 13:13.290
and the earnest expectations of our uncles and elders.

13:18.700 --> 13:19.500
Keep up the good work.

13:19.520 --> 13:20.250
Okay.

13:20.410 --> 13:21.340
And we

13:21.520 --> 13:23.200
are just like migrating birds,

13:23.710 --> 13:24.800
no matter how tired

13:25.230 --> 13:26.210
or busy,

13:26.630 --> 13:27.830
every year,

13:27.900 --> 13:29.910
we'd take the same train

13:30.190 --> 13:31.630
and return to our hometown.

13:32.350 --> 13:32.990
It's the New Year.

13:33.030 --> 13:34.470
What wishes do you have?

13:34.660 --> 13:36.190
I hope we all

13:36.190 --> 13:38.090
have good luck in Beijing!

13:39.230 --> 13:42.420
I hope I can make more money!

13:43.300 --> 13:44.920
Then I wish you both

13:45.760 --> 13:47.060
all the best!

13:47.080 --> 13:48.700
May all our wishes come true.

13:49.790 --> 13:50.600
Xie Wanghe.

14:07.730 --> 14:08.720
Happy New Year.

14:11.890 --> 14:12.730
Happy New Year.

14:12.800 --> 14:13.840
Happy New Year.

14:17.790 --> 14:21.480
Happy New Year!

14:22.610 --> 14:25.040
Only at this moment do we realize

14:25.590 --> 14:27.700
that we've grown up

14:27.790 --> 14:28.960
without noticing.

14:32.250 --> 14:34.560
[2014]

14:37.310 --> 14:41.590
[Fenghua Express]

14:38.550 --> 14:39.300
Fenghua.

14:39.770 --> 14:40.610
Fenghua, you're back.

14:41.270 --> 14:43.150
After years of hard work,

14:43.230 --> 14:44.190
I, Fenghua, finally

14:44.190 --> 14:46.980
got a place to myself in Beijing,

14:47.110 --> 14:49.350
an express delivery station that belongs to me

14:49.370 --> 14:50.630
in Haidian district.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.820
Good work.

14:52.220 --> 14:53.310
Remember to deliver it.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.790
Thank you.

14:57.060 --> 14:57.760
Fenghua.

14:57.790 --> 14:59.320
Shall we deliver the package to Jinxiu Nancheng Community?

14:59.430 --> 15:00.190
Deliver it right away.

15:00.270 --> 15:01.000
Customers are the most important.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.830
Got it!

15:17.270 --> 15:18.440
Graduation certificate?

15:20.150 --> 15:21.430
[Graduation Certificate]

15:29.070 --> 15:30.400
[Chen Rui]

15:31.480 --> 15:33.930
Hello, where are you now?

15:35.470 --> 15:37.430
Okay, I'll come pick you up in a bit.

15:39.020 --> 15:41.160
It's all right. It's a bit congested at this time anyway.

15:41.280 --> 15:42.700
See you later. Bye-bye.

15:47.070 --> 15:48.790
Careful, careful.

15:49.090 --> 15:50.950
Careful. Careful!

16:05.870 --> 16:07.650
We're all well aware of your achievements.

16:07.780 --> 16:08.550
Over the past few years,

16:08.550 --> 16:09.750
you've trained

16:09.750 --> 16:11.680
a formidable ground promotion team for Bee.

16:11.710 --> 16:12.670
While other platforms

16:12.670 --> 16:13.510
were burning money

16:13.510 --> 16:15.080
to grab market share,

16:15.350 --> 16:16.710
you led your team

16:16.710 --> 16:18.470
to work hard in second, third, and fourth-tier cities.

16:18.470 --> 16:20.100
In over sixty cities,

16:20.130 --> 16:22.520
you've attained the top market share.

16:22.650 --> 16:23.630
This accomplishment

16:23.650 --> 16:24.630
helped Bee

16:24.770 --> 16:26.470
successfully complete its Series C funding.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.630
It's impressive.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.610
This is mainly because

16:30.010 --> 16:31.900
the boss's designated strategy was well-executed.

16:32.220 --> 16:33.970
We just carried it out.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.770
At most, we put in some effort.

16:35.940 --> 16:37.260
You're being too modest.

16:37.540 --> 16:39.300
So capable yet so humble.

16:39.390 --> 16:40.390
No wonder my client

16:40.390 --> 16:42.350
is willing to pay such a high price to poach you.

16:43.090 --> 16:44.220
At Bee,

16:44.240 --> 16:46.140
even if you reach the top,

16:46.530 --> 16:47.870
at most you'll be

16:47.910 --> 16:49.290
a VP in charge of sales,

16:49.330 --> 16:50.730
doing all the hard and tiring work.

16:50.830 --> 16:52.920
But if you switch to a different platform,

16:53.020 --> 16:54.950
your room for growth will be different.

16:54.980 --> 16:57.010
Your horizons will be broadened.

16:58.980 --> 17:00.410
As Gu knows,

17:00.830 --> 17:03.200
I'm doing quite well at Bee.

17:03.360 --> 17:05.859
I have no plans to switch jobs for now.

17:18.550 --> 17:19.230
Hello?

17:19.859 --> 17:20.670
Hello?

17:20.930 --> 17:21.970
Where are you?

17:22.300 --> 17:23.790
I've been calling you for ages and you're not picking up.

17:23.880 --> 17:24.410
Where are you?

17:24.440 --> 17:25.040
Here. Over here.

17:27.839 --> 17:31.150
[No. 001, Zhongguancun Avenue]

17:31.480 --> 17:32.070
Bro.

17:33.720 --> 17:34.340
What?

17:34.380 --> 17:35.090
Where's the money?

17:35.830 --> 17:37.060
Don't worry.

17:37.090 --> 17:37.830
It's the only one in Beijing.

17:37.830 --> 17:39.120
It's absolutely authentic. Hurry up.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.340
Are you sure it can be verified?

17:43.030 --> 17:44.710
It's registered on the Ministry of Education's website.

17:45.180 --> 17:46.550
Otherwise, would I dare to sell it for 20,000?

17:46.960 --> 17:48.970
Come on, 20,000 is too expensive, bro.

17:49.030 --> 17:50.190
Can't you give me a better price?

17:50.210 --> 17:51.510
Do you know what you're saying?

17:51.530 --> 17:53.340
You think 20,000 for a doctorate is expensive?

17:54.010 --> 17:55.830
Do you know how much it costs to actually get a doctorate?

17:57.770 --> 17:58.300
Hurry up.

17:59.730 --> 18:01.250
I still want to see the certificate first.

18:01.890 --> 18:03.520
Otherwise, I won't feel at ease.

18:03.550 --> 18:05.470
Besides, this money isn't just pocket change.

18:05.730 --> 18:08.210
You've got to let me see the sample first, right?

18:10.040 --> 18:10.980
Are you sure you'll buy it?

18:11.010 --> 18:11.750
Yes, I'm sure.

18:20.480 --> 18:21.340
You know what?

18:21.430 --> 18:22.600
This does look quite real.

18:22.620 --> 18:23.710
It is real.

18:22.680 --> 18:24.510
[PhD Graduate Certificate]

18:33.320 --> 18:34.090
Stop!

18:35.480 --> 18:36.170
Stop!

18:37.350 --> 18:37.870
Stop!

18:37.890 --> 18:39.530
Don't run! Don't run!

18:40.180 --> 18:41.840
Excuse me! Coming through!

18:44.880 --> 18:46.610
Stop! Don't run!

18:47.350 --> 18:48.110
Shao Xingchi!

18:48.750 --> 18:49.650
Stop!

18:50.750 --> 18:51.510
Don't run!

18:52.020 --> 18:52.870
Stop!

18:57.060 --> 18:58.990
Catch him! Catch him!

19:00.030 --> 19:01.480
Move! Move!

19:01.480 --> 19:02.550
Excuse me! Coming through! Make way!

19:02.550 --> 19:04.730
Excuse me! Sorry! Pardon me!

19:04.870 --> 19:05.670
Make way!

19:10.460 --> 19:12.380
[Xingchi]

19:14.580 --> 19:15.430
I'm sorry.

19:15.460 --> 19:16.270
Excuse me.

19:16.270 --> 19:17.000
Hello.

19:17.000 --> 19:19.430
The number you dialed is busy now.

19:19.900 --> 19:21.200
Please try again later.

19:26.800 --> 19:28.110
[Xingchi]

19:26.860 --> 19:29.740
Judging from the current market demand,

19:29.830 --> 19:30.870
Java is still the mainstream.

19:30.890 --> 19:32.030
The underlying logic of most commercial websites

19:32.070 --> 19:34.320
in the market today

19:34.380 --> 19:35.070
is still primarily based on

19:35.070 --> 19:35.920
Java.

19:39.340 --> 19:41.110
So, Java's application platforms

19:41.110 --> 19:42.500
include JavaSE, JavaEE,

19:42.500 --> 19:43.620
and JavaME.

19:43.840 --> 19:45.620
In common application areas,

19:46.060 --> 19:47.390
it's obvious that

19:47.430 --> 19:49.110
web applications are still dominant.

19:49.150 --> 19:50.910
Wanghe and the others have to work, so they can't come over now.

19:50.930 --> 19:51.970
We'll meet at home tonight.

19:52.170 --> 19:52.770
Okay.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.870
What brings you to Beijing this time?

19:54.940 --> 19:55.790
There's an expo.

19:55.820 --> 19:56.850
Isn't the canal applying for World Heritage status?

19:56.880 --> 19:58.040
I'm here to lend a hand.

20:03.110 --> 20:03.830
Hello?

20:04.090 --> 20:05.320
I might be detained.

20:06.020 --> 20:06.760
Stop!

20:08.300 --> 20:09.100
Stop!

20:12.750 --> 20:14.020
Excuse me. Excuse me.

20:16.520 --> 20:17.480
Shao Xingchi!

20:23.100 --> 20:24.480
Shao Xingchi.

20:24.730 --> 20:26.110
It's you again, Officer Xia.

20:26.130 --> 20:26.770
Take him away.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.320
What happened?

20:30.980 --> 20:32.240
Xingchi has been detained again.

20:33.690 --> 20:34.390
Again?

20:35.190 --> 20:36.200
He sells fake IDs.

20:36.230 --> 20:38.230
I've had to bail him out several times already.

20:38.980 --> 20:40.070
No time to talk.

20:40.090 --> 20:40.930
Let's get a taxi first.

20:48.900 --> 20:50.280
Mr. Xie, you're back.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.770
Mr. Xie, you're back.

20:58.250 --> 20:59.030
Hello, Mr. Xie.

20:59.070 --> 20:59.590
Mr. Xie.

21:00.430 --> 21:02.260
I need your department's plan as soon as possible.

21:02.300 --> 21:03.640
Alright, got it.

21:05.540 --> 21:06.450
Hello, Mr. Xie.

21:06.790 --> 21:07.470
Mr. Meng.

21:10.180 --> 21:11.940
What took you so long?

21:12.650 --> 21:14.410
A headhunting company wanted to poach me.

21:14.440 --> 21:15.330
We chatted for a bit.

21:15.700 --> 21:16.880
Which company is it this time?

21:16.910 --> 21:17.640
I didn't ask.

21:17.710 --> 21:20.170
I guess it's either Yuntu or Eat Well.

21:20.210 --> 21:22.760
Now everyone realizes the importance of ground promotion.

21:22.790 --> 21:24.300
Many people in the ground promotion team I led before

21:24.340 --> 21:25.620
have been poached.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.390
Their salaries are now double what we offer.

21:28.110 --> 21:28.510
Come on.

21:28.650 --> 21:29.190
Look at that.

21:29.550 --> 21:31.350
We've covered several more places.

21:32.380 --> 21:34.720
Make sure you retain our core staff.

21:35.500 --> 21:36.910
For someone at my level,

21:36.910 --> 21:38.510
with stock options, it should be okay.

21:38.530 --> 21:40.510
As for the lower-level staff, we still need to retain them with salaries.

21:41.180 --> 21:42.930
And the top priority after that

21:43.200 --> 21:45.110
is to refine management and training.

21:45.900 --> 21:47.220
I have complied

21:47.220 --> 21:48.270
the training manual for ground promotion.

21:48.700 --> 21:50.460
I will arrange personnel to implement it step by step.

21:50.640 --> 21:52.640
Good. It's very thorough.

21:53.280 --> 21:55.860
We've had a pretty high market share in second and third-tier cities.

21:56.030 --> 21:58.080
Next step, we're going to target first-tier cities.

21:58.670 --> 22:00.070
From now on, you'll be based in Beijing.

22:00.200 --> 22:01.150
Help me keep an eye on the business,

22:01.350 --> 22:02.270
especially in Haidian district.

22:04.060 --> 22:05.660
Can you give me another district?

22:05.700 --> 22:06.490
No.

22:11.730 --> 22:12.450
You have concerns?

22:15.310 --> 22:17.830
Qiu Lin, Chief of Haidian Distribution Station,

22:18.520 --> 22:20.160
is Song's brother-in-law.

22:20.320 --> 22:22.290
And Song is a veteran in our company.

22:22.450 --> 22:23.570
It's impossible to handle.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.500
Veteran.

22:36.420 --> 22:38.150
What does being a veteran matter?

22:38.740 --> 22:39.730
Even the company

22:39.750 --> 22:41.360
is at a critical moment of survival.

22:41.940 --> 22:42.600
Face-saving

22:42.880 --> 22:44.030
isn't that important.

22:47.160 --> 22:48.300
What will be my main responsibilities

22:48.390 --> 22:49.390
after I relocate to Haidian?

22:50.540 --> 22:52.300
In the shortest time possible,

22:52.340 --> 22:53.270
increase our market share

22:53.290 --> 22:55.160
to over 50%.

22:55.190 --> 22:55.990
To achieve this,

22:56.020 --> 22:57.580
you can use any means necessary.

22:57.610 --> 22:59.050
Can I touch Song?

22:59.920 --> 23:02.090
Why are you already thinking about flipping the table before you even arrive?

23:02.130 --> 23:02.930
It's not like that.

23:04.060 --> 23:05.580
If he doesn't cause me any trouble,

23:05.610 --> 23:06.890
I certainly won't let him lose face.

23:06.910 --> 23:09.440
But if he conflicts with my work,

23:09.470 --> 23:11.040
then don't blame me for not respecting the elderly.

23:11.220 --> 23:13.220
Otherwise, I can't do the job.

23:20.040 --> 23:21.830
I only care about market share.

23:22.420 --> 23:23.640
On this premise,

23:23.840 --> 23:25.140
there're no constraints.

23:27.370 --> 23:28.130
Alright.

23:28.600 --> 23:30.250
I was waiting for you to say that.

23:30.290 --> 23:32.120
If I can't increase the market share to 50%,

23:32.140 --> 23:33.040
I'll throw myself out.

23:33.820 --> 23:34.990
You said it.

23:42.950 --> 23:43.750
Stand up straight.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.560
Other than this,

23:50.950 --> 23:52.440
don't you have any other means of making a living?

23:53.630 --> 23:54.430
I do.

23:55.510 --> 23:57.540
I used to run a karaoke box,

23:57.560 --> 23:58.460
and it closed down.

23:59.590 --> 24:02.270
I also worked as a real estate agent.

24:02.470 --> 24:03.430
I didn't make any money from that either.

24:03.450 --> 24:04.730
Illegal money-making businesses

24:04.760 --> 24:06.320
are all written in the law.

24:06.340 --> 24:07.780
I'm not that greedy for money.

24:08.270 --> 24:09.220
But

24:09.600 --> 24:11.270
at least I have to survive, right?

24:11.270 --> 24:12.670
There are so many people working in Beijing.

24:12.690 --> 24:14.120
Did they all starve to death since they didn't take shortcuts?

24:14.310 --> 24:15.650
Don't try to persuade me.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.250
If I had any other way out,

24:17.250 --> 24:19.020
I wouldn't have risked my own future.

24:19.070 --> 24:19.950
Don't you agree?

24:24.030 --> 24:31.580
[Interrogation Room 1] [Interrogation Room 2]

24:24.920 --> 24:26.460
Shao Xingchi, come out.

24:36.970 --> 24:37.490
Let's go.

24:42.170 --> 24:43.520
Officer Xia, I've brought him here.

24:43.740 --> 24:44.420
Untie him.

24:46.520 --> 24:48.280
Fill out the form first, then complete the procedures.

24:49.630 --> 24:51.130
Keep your phone turned on.

24:51.760 --> 24:52.800
Officer Xia.

24:53.190 --> 24:55.140
What if my phone runs out of battery?

24:57.500 --> 24:58.270
Are you crazy?

24:58.270 --> 25:00.110
You're addicted to coming to the police station, aren't you?

25:00.130 --> 25:01.010
Let's complete the procedures first.

25:01.070 --> 25:02.190
-Let's talk outside.
-Alright, alright.

25:02.190 --> 25:02.750
Who's going to process the paperwork?

25:02.770 --> 25:03.250
I'll do it.

25:03.290 --> 25:03.630
Come with me.

25:23.520 --> 25:25.080
What are you going to do next?

25:27.790 --> 25:28.720
None of your business.

25:32.180 --> 25:33.140
Xingchi.

25:33.350 --> 25:34.830
The police have already warned you.

25:34.870 --> 25:36.980
If you don't change your line of work, you'll end up in jail again.

25:43.810 --> 25:44.990
If you keep doing this,

25:45.020 --> 25:46.680
I'll call your mother.

26:01.790 --> 26:02.950
When I was learning how to modify cars,

26:02.950 --> 26:04.150
I got burned by the exhaust pipe and got this scar.

26:05.350 --> 26:06.160
This one was from

26:06.390 --> 26:07.990
when I was running a karaoke box. Someone got drunk

26:07.990 --> 26:08.590
and stabbed me.

26:10.960 --> 26:12.210
And this scar on my leg.

26:18.790 --> 26:19.720
You deserve it.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.760
It's all your own doing.

26:26.790 --> 26:28.390
Do you know how I've been living?

26:31.550 --> 26:33.220
My pirated DVD store got raided.

26:34.890 --> 26:36.670
My street vending cart was confiscated by the city management.

26:36.700 --> 26:38.750
I finally saved enough money to open a karaoke box with some friends,

26:38.790 --> 26:39.910
and someone was caught doing drugs inside.

26:39.910 --> 26:41.350
So it got shut down!

26:41.360 --> 26:42.750
Since I came to Beijing,

26:42.780 --> 26:44.650
not a single thing has gone my way!

26:48.240 --> 26:49.920
You can't blame others

26:49.940 --> 26:50.860
for not doing well yourself.

26:51.840 --> 26:53.910
You only have yourself to blame.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.450
It's only been a few years.

27:07.850 --> 27:09.740
How did he become like this?

27:21.440 --> 27:22.260
Mom.

27:22.290 --> 27:24.840
Son, why was your phone turned off?

27:25.040 --> 27:26.580
I was in a meeting just now.

27:26.750 --> 27:27.750
Where are you?

27:27.780 --> 27:30.140
Your dad and I are resting by the roadside.

27:30.450 --> 27:31.320
What's Dad doing?

27:31.620 --> 27:32.420
He's changing the tire.

27:32.980 --> 27:35.400
Son, how have you been lately?

27:35.530 --> 27:36.790
Is your stomach still acting up?

27:36.850 --> 27:37.910
I'm fine.

27:38.490 --> 27:40.680
I had to wine and dine some clients in the past couple of days.

27:40.800 --> 27:42.320
I'll take some stomach medicine, and I'll be fine.

27:43.110 --> 27:44.720
You shouldn't take too much Western medicine.

27:44.750 --> 27:46.590
You should see a traditional Chinese doctor for treatment.

27:46.790 --> 27:48.520
I've seen one. Don't worry.

27:48.700 --> 27:50.520
By the way, check your card.

27:50.540 --> 27:51.820
I transferred some money to you yesterday.

27:52.150 --> 27:53.070
I've received it.

27:54.180 --> 27:55.390
With this money you sent

27:55.410 --> 27:56.900
and this run we're making,

27:57.140 --> 27:59.960
our family's debts will be completely cleared.

28:00.200 --> 28:01.060
That's good.

28:01.570 --> 28:03.360
This way, you and Dad can make fewer runs from now on.

28:03.430 --> 28:04.750
Don't work so hard.

28:05.230 --> 28:06.990
We'd just be sitting idle at home anyway.

28:07.080 --> 28:09.570
At least we can enjoy the scenery while driving.

28:09.750 --> 28:10.390
Alright.

28:10.390 --> 28:12.270
Don't worry about your dad and me.

28:12.290 --> 28:13.550
Just take good care of

28:13.670 --> 28:14.740
your own health.

28:15.110 --> 28:15.750
Okay.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.970
There's no need to worry about me.

28:17.650 --> 28:18.940
Keep an eye on Dad.

28:19.190 --> 28:20.370
He's hot-tempered.

28:20.390 --> 28:21.960
Keep an eye on him.

28:23.500 --> 28:24.210
Okay. Okay.

28:24.230 --> 28:25.460
Bye-bye.

28:28.000 --> 28:28.720
Who was that?

28:29.340 --> 28:30.960
Our son. Who else could it be?

28:31.100 --> 28:32.140
How is he?

28:32.950 --> 28:34.720
Same as always.

28:34.750 --> 28:36.260
He only tells us good news and never bad news.

28:36.540 --> 28:38.690
He never tells us the truth.

28:38.730 --> 28:39.990
If we want to know what's really going on with him...

28:39.990 --> 28:41.030
Don't get your hands dirty.

28:41.050 --> 28:42.620
We'd have to ask those kids he hangs out with.

28:43.370 --> 28:45.020
Weren't we also like that when we were young?

28:45.050 --> 28:46.290
No matter how tough and tiring it was out there,

28:46.330 --> 28:47.450
we had to endure it ourselves.

28:47.470 --> 28:48.490
When we got home,

28:48.960 --> 28:51.070
we could brag all we wanted.

28:54.600 --> 28:55.920
With the money our son sent us,

28:55.950 --> 28:57.390
our family's debts will be cleared.

28:57.530 --> 28:58.500
After we complete this run,

28:58.760 --> 28:59.650
let's take a break.

29:00.140 --> 29:01.500
Here's what I'm thinking.

29:01.940 --> 29:02.840
Look.

29:03.230 --> 29:04.800
Our son has come of age.

29:05.180 --> 29:06.190
It's time for him to get married.

29:06.730 --> 29:08.400
What if they want to buy a house in Beijing?

29:08.430 --> 29:09.270
We can't

29:09.310 --> 29:10.700
contribute nothing, right?

29:12.960 --> 29:14.110
Forget about taking a break then.

29:14.410 --> 29:15.230
Let's keep working.

29:16.590 --> 29:18.590
Why didn't your parents think of

29:18.610 --> 29:19.830
buying you a house back then?

29:19.870 --> 29:22.200
We've been renting for so many years.

29:22.270 --> 29:23.870
Stop saying useless things.

29:24.680 --> 29:25.670
Back then, it was...

29:26.110 --> 29:27.320
Don't get your hands dirty. Give it to me.

29:27.830 --> 29:28.870
Back then, the government allotted the house to us.

29:28.900 --> 29:29.820
Now, to buy a house,

29:29.850 --> 29:31.370
the whole family would be exhausted to death.

29:32.560 --> 29:33.710
Your son definitely won't be like that.

29:33.710 --> 29:34.470
I believe in him.

29:34.470 --> 29:35.660
He's definitely better than you.

29:35.980 --> 29:37.000
You are always right.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.360
Mr. Du.

29:41.150 --> 29:42.110
Mr. Du.

29:43.690 --> 29:44.320
You're here.

29:48.260 --> 29:49.260
You don't have to

29:49.560 --> 29:50.810
bring gifts.

29:50.870 --> 29:52.550
How could I come empty-handed?

29:56.540 --> 29:58.350
About Xingchi's matter,

29:58.650 --> 30:00.170
it's not that I don't agree.

30:01.390 --> 30:02.300
The point is

30:03.090 --> 30:04.850
whether he's willing to learn this craft or not.

30:04.890 --> 30:06.220
Whether he wants to or not,

30:06.250 --> 30:07.980
he has to learn.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.690
If he doesn't learn, I'll break his legs.

30:13.260 --> 30:15.070
Isn't he doing pretty well in Beijing?

30:15.110 --> 30:16.440
Why are you urging him to come back?

30:16.790 --> 30:17.590
Don't get me started.

30:17.610 --> 30:18.990
If he doesn't come back soon,

30:19.020 --> 30:20.950
his mother and I will worry ourselves to death.

30:22.180 --> 30:22.960
What happened?

30:25.040 --> 30:26.390
I don't mind telling you.

30:27.270 --> 30:28.380
You know, when Xingchi

30:28.430 --> 30:29.630
was a kid,

30:30.100 --> 30:31.480
he was quite well-behaved.

30:32.140 --> 30:34.070
But since he went to Beijing,

30:34.300 --> 30:36.540
he's been causing trouble every other day.

30:36.710 --> 30:38.960
He's been arrested and taken to the police station two or three times already.

30:39.110 --> 30:40.440
Every time he'd say

30:40.590 --> 30:41.510
it wasn't his fault.

30:41.530 --> 30:42.570
He was just unlucky.

30:43.200 --> 30:43.830
But you know,

30:43.870 --> 30:45.950
other kids don't get themselves into that kind of trouble.

30:46.760 --> 30:48.860
You know what kind of person I am.

30:49.500 --> 30:51.230
I don't easily ask for favors.

30:52.150 --> 30:54.110
But for Xingchi,

30:54.140 --> 30:54.750
Mr. Du,

30:55.860 --> 30:57.440
you really need to help me.

31:00.120 --> 31:00.830
Have some tea.

31:07.940 --> 31:11.240
[Xiuchun Suzhou Embroidery Shop]

31:08.730 --> 31:09.540
All the clothes here in my shop

31:09.620 --> 31:10.900
are hand-embroidered.

31:11.000 --> 31:12.140
They need it urgently.

31:12.140 --> 31:13.680
I don't want to cause delays for them.

31:16.110 --> 31:17.820
Please take your time to choose.

31:20.180 --> 31:21.020
How did it go?

31:21.040 --> 31:22.280
Mr. Du agreed.

31:22.380 --> 31:23.510
That's great!

31:23.550 --> 31:24.420
Give him a call

31:24.420 --> 31:25.300
and ask him to come back quickly.

31:25.390 --> 31:26.230
Okay.

31:26.290 --> 31:27.080
I'll be off then.

31:27.150 --> 31:28.390
Where are you going?

31:28.740 --> 31:29.980
I'm going to the sunken ship.

31:30.010 --> 31:32.180
Chen and Mr. Zhou are waiting for me there.

31:32.310 --> 31:33.540
They said they had a new discovery.

31:33.810 --> 31:34.350
I'm off then.

31:36.330 --> 31:37.970
The sunken ship is even more important than your son.

31:41.270 --> 31:42.270
Hello.

31:42.270 --> 31:44.430
The subscriber you dialed is power off.

31:51.750 --> 31:54.110
The canal in Tongzhou is different from what I thought.

31:54.140 --> 31:55.650
It's quite beautiful at night.

32:00.470 --> 32:02.340
You might as well open a restaurant.

32:02.450 --> 32:03.940
We'll chip in some money for you.

32:03.970 --> 32:05.000
Find a good location

32:05.040 --> 32:06.190
and open a Huaiyang snack shop.

32:07.150 --> 32:08.040
It won't make money.

32:08.120 --> 32:10.510
How do you know it won't make money if you haven't tried?

32:10.550 --> 32:11.870
Your cooking skills are so good.

32:12.020 --> 32:13.590
If you have something to say, just say it.

32:13.630 --> 32:15.020
I'm not that thin-skinned.

32:15.770 --> 32:17.170
Is everything okay between them?

32:17.960 --> 32:18.750
Yes.

32:20.160 --> 32:21.510
I've already criticized Xingchi.

32:21.880 --> 32:22.820
What did he say?

32:22.860 --> 32:24.410
He believes he did nothing wrong.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.380
Stubborn as hell.

32:25.760 --> 32:27.700
For this kind of thing, we still need Wanghe to step in.

32:29.090 --> 32:30.960
Do you believe those two could actually fight?

32:31.430 --> 32:32.430
It can't be that bad, right?

32:32.620 --> 32:33.960
They're as close as brothers after all.

32:35.130 --> 32:35.920
What do you want to bet on?

32:35.950 --> 32:37.850
Can't you just stay out of trouble?

32:38.160 --> 32:39.600
Would it kill you to make some honest money?

32:39.630 --> 32:40.830
There are so many people forging certificates.

32:40.850 --> 32:42.170
Why am I the only one getting caught?

32:42.200 --> 32:44.440
I'm contributing to society, right?

32:44.460 --> 32:46.780
What's wrong with helping increase the employment rate?

32:46.810 --> 32:48.090
I don't blame Fenghua for not understanding me.

32:48.120 --> 32:48.680
I accept that.

32:48.710 --> 32:50.390
How can you, Mr. Know-it-all, not tell right from wrong?

32:50.420 --> 32:52.380
What kind of bullshit theory is this?

32:52.400 --> 32:53.700
I can't tell right from wrong?

32:54.030 --> 32:54.780
Bro,

32:54.830 --> 32:56.680
how many messes have you made over these years?

32:56.710 --> 32:58.280
Do you want me to list them all out for you?

32:58.300 --> 32:59.220
And I'm the one that can't tell right from wrong?

32:59.250 --> 33:00.500
It's always the same old story with you.

33:00.520 --> 33:01.700
Are you senile or something?

33:02.980 --> 33:03.740
Let's eat!

33:03.900 --> 33:04.770
Aren't you hungry?

33:20.030 --> 33:20.840
Wait a moment.

33:20.860 --> 33:21.980
I've got something nice to show you.

33:27.560 --> 33:29.210
[Graduation Certificate]

33:31.160 --> 33:31.730
[Graduation Certificate]

33:32.410 --> 33:34.120
Not bad, Fenghua.

33:34.200 --> 33:35.940
You've finally grown a brain.

33:35.970 --> 33:36.930
Just a moment.

33:36.950 --> 33:38.240
Well done!

33:38.920 --> 33:40.710
Name: Xia Fenghua.

33:40.730 --> 33:42.780
Major: Business Management.

33:42.810 --> 33:45.410
Self-study Higher Education Examination for Bachelor's Degree.

33:45.430 --> 33:47.230
Passed all courses.

33:47.260 --> 33:49.260
Approved for graduation.

33:49.290 --> 33:50.130
Well done!

33:51.840 --> 33:52.710
Come on, everyone.

33:53.170 --> 33:56.300
Let's raise a toast to Ms. Xia.

33:56.540 --> 33:57.230
Cheers!

33:57.270 --> 33:59.060
Congratulations!

33:59.090 --> 34:00.780
Is a self-study diploma also considered a diploma?

34:03.580 --> 34:04.710
Xingchi, seriously?

34:04.710 --> 34:06.510
With her diploma, would you let her come for an interview at your company?

34:06.530 --> 34:08.330
I'm doing well with my own business.

34:08.380 --> 34:09.610
Why would I interview at his company?

34:09.630 --> 34:11.510
You've started your own business, why bother getting a diploma?

34:11.540 --> 34:12.600
You must have too much time on your hands.

34:14.850 --> 34:16.520
Xingchi, you're not doing badly because of us, right?

34:16.550 --> 34:17.670
It has nothing to do with you.

34:18.139 --> 34:19.679
I'm just unlucky!

34:19.710 --> 34:21.070
It has nothing to do with any of you!

34:21.090 --> 34:22.500
Then why are you like this all day?

34:22.520 --> 34:23.510
Being all sarcastic

34:23.540 --> 34:24.630
and having such an odd way of speaking!

34:24.670 --> 34:25.710
As if we owe you something!

34:25.710 --> 34:26.270
Stop it!

34:26.270 --> 34:27.310
Let him speak!

34:27.330 --> 34:28.420
A successful person, aren't you?

34:28.449 --> 34:29.070
Give us backward folks

34:29.070 --> 34:30.550
some advanced advice!

34:30.580 --> 34:31.429
How much motivational crap do you have?

34:31.550 --> 34:32.030
I'll take it all!

34:32.070 --> 34:33.270
You bastard, Shao Xingchi!

34:33.270 --> 34:34.480
Can't you stop fighting?

34:34.510 --> 34:36.040
Are you two still high school students?

34:39.330 --> 34:40.580
Sit down. Sit down.

35:09.420 --> 35:11.330
You work in Haidian.

35:11.660 --> 35:13.270
Why do you live so far away from work?

35:14.830 --> 35:16.020
Don't you think

35:17.230 --> 35:18.900
the smell here is similar to home?

35:20.830 --> 35:22.070
If there were a ship,

35:22.700 --> 35:23.750
we could sail

35:24.390 --> 35:26.080
all the way home along the river.

35:31.270 --> 35:32.090
You guys

35:36.190 --> 35:37.560
must look down on me, right?

35:37.730 --> 35:38.500
Yes.

35:42.450 --> 35:44.070
You've been causing trouble these past two years.

35:44.230 --> 35:45.220
When we tell you off,

35:45.260 --> 35:46.900
we don't feel good about it either.

35:46.920 --> 35:47.920
Then don't say anything.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.250
I know what I'm doing.

35:49.520 --> 35:50.630
You know what you're doing?

35:51.650 --> 35:53.500
I don't even want to bother talking to you.

35:53.890 --> 35:54.490
Yeah.

35:55.340 --> 35:57.340
I got caught making fake IDs this time.

35:57.760 --> 36:00.130
But it gave me a new idea.

36:00.740 --> 36:01.580
What idea?

36:01.860 --> 36:03.160
When I save up enough money,

36:03.870 --> 36:05.710
I'll find some diploma mills abroad.

36:05.730 --> 36:06.620
They're all real.

36:07.120 --> 36:08.120
The certificates will all be genuine.

36:08.380 --> 36:10.370
Let's see how the police can catch me then.

36:11.200 --> 36:12.720
Can't you find some other way?

36:13.050 --> 36:14.120
This is too risky.

36:14.640 --> 36:16.280
As long as you're willing to work hard

36:16.300 --> 36:17.450
and not try to exploit legal loopholes,

36:17.470 --> 36:18.740
we'll all support you.

36:18.780 --> 36:20.810
Who has the time to bother with you anyway?

36:22.040 --> 36:23.850
We know you're in a bad state of mind,

36:23.870 --> 36:24.570
and you feel anxious.

36:24.610 --> 36:26.500
But we haven't made it big either.

36:26.530 --> 36:27.830
We're also working hard from dawn to dusk,

36:27.830 --> 36:28.790
gritting our teeth and pushing forward, aren't we?

36:28.790 --> 36:30.230
You all went to prestigious universities.

36:31.260 --> 36:32.940
After a few years of hard work,

36:32.980 --> 36:33.770
you'll all have bright futures.

36:33.960 --> 36:34.870
So what?

36:34.900 --> 36:36.660
Is Fenghua a graduate from a famous university?

36:37.920 --> 36:39.730
Look at her. With her IQ,

36:39.760 --> 36:41.430
she couldn't even understand basic arithmetic.

36:41.470 --> 36:42.390
But at this age,

36:42.390 --> 36:44.100
she managed to self-study and get a degree.

36:44.340 --> 36:45.630
You didn't support or encourage her,

36:45.650 --> 36:46.960
and even made sarcastic remarks instead.

36:47.070 --> 36:48.780
Do you think you're doing the right thing?

36:51.520 --> 36:52.850
I'll go kowtow to her.

36:52.890 --> 36:53.720
Stop it.

36:54.860 --> 36:56.090
Can't you read the room?

37:02.540 --> 37:03.790
Just try not to upset her again in the future.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.280
Oh, right.

37:15.960 --> 37:16.550
This.

37:17.930 --> 37:18.370
For you.

37:19.970 --> 37:20.560
What is it?

37:21.130 --> 37:24.970
The money you paid as compensation when you got into a fight for me during our senior year.

37:27.620 --> 37:28.750
Are you serious?

37:29.140 --> 37:30.620
It's been so long.

37:31.520 --> 37:33.550
You may have moved on, but I haven't.

37:33.810 --> 37:35.790
That incident caused a lot of trouble for you and your family.

37:36.340 --> 37:37.710
I didn't have the money back then,

37:37.710 --> 37:38.730
so I could only pretend to be ignorant.

37:38.770 --> 37:40.430
I've been saving money all these years.

37:40.450 --> 37:41.330
I've finally saved enough.

37:41.780 --> 37:42.370
Here.

37:45.730 --> 37:46.730
Are you crazy?

37:47.350 --> 37:48.230
Take it.

37:48.270 --> 37:48.550
I won't.

37:48.550 --> 37:49.430
Just take it.

37:49.470 --> 37:50.040
I won't take it.

37:50.070 --> 37:51.230
If you don't take it, I'll give it to your parents.

37:51.270 --> 37:52.510
Even if you give it to them, they won't accept it.

37:52.630 --> 37:53.470
Hey, Xie Wanghe.

37:53.470 --> 37:54.790
Can't you stop being so selfish?

37:54.830 --> 37:55.830
I'm selfish?

37:55.970 --> 37:57.140
Because I feel

37:57.570 --> 37:59.800
that I've worked hard on my own all these years

37:59.860 --> 38:01.470
to make up for my childhood mistakes.

38:01.490 --> 38:03.180
I'll feel a great sense of accomplishment.

38:05.190 --> 38:06.350
You take it for now.

38:06.350 --> 38:07.710
I'll ask you for money when I need it.

38:07.730 --> 38:08.210
Is that okay?

38:10.760 --> 38:11.450
Sure.

38:11.880 --> 38:13.110
Then I'll keep it safe for you.

38:15.630 --> 38:16.280
Let's go.

38:22.230 --> 38:22.820
Where is everyone?

38:29.390 --> 38:31.030
They left without saying goodbye.

38:35.030 --> 38:35.790
Yes, they're gone.

38:37.470 --> 38:38.280
We're all drunk.

38:38.300 --> 38:39.330
We're off.

38:39.360 --> 38:40.450
Sorry about today.

38:43.290 --> 38:45.050
Xingchi is just reluctant to admit his mistakes.

38:47.590 --> 38:48.350
Alright then.

38:48.350 --> 38:49.030
I'm off too.

38:49.080 --> 38:49.850
I'll walk you out.

38:49.990 --> 38:50.790
No need.

38:50.870 --> 38:52.850
You still have to get up early for work tomorrow.

38:53.310 --> 38:54.190
I'll walk you to the subway then.

38:55.430 --> 38:56.010
Okay.

39:01.630 --> 39:05.790
♫What would you do without me?♫

39:06.390 --> 39:10.590
♫Who would wipe away your tears?♫

39:11.590 --> 39:13.890
♫Who would hold an umbrella for you?♫

39:13.900 --> 39:16.070
♫Comfort you when you're troubled♫

39:16.100 --> 39:20.580
♫On sleepless nights, you fear loneliness the most♫

39:22.580 --> 39:24.300
That time, you sprained your ankle,

39:24.990 --> 39:26.420
and I carried you on my back all night.

39:26.450 --> 39:27.820
I almost died from exhaustion.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.720
Aren't you alive and well?

39:31.220 --> 39:32.570
Isn't that thanks to you?

39:37.510 --> 39:39.620
Time really flies.

39:40.590 --> 39:42.270
Yes, it does.

39:44.100 --> 39:46.540
Back then, I was a beautiful young girl.

39:48.710 --> 39:49.900
What are you now?

39:50.580 --> 39:51.520
An old lady?

39:59.110 --> 40:00.330
When I was a kid,

40:01.370 --> 40:02.620
I loved Beijing,

40:03.420 --> 40:04.920
because Beijing is big enough,

40:05.250 --> 40:06.690
unimaginably big.

40:07.770 --> 40:08.950
It made me feel

40:10.160 --> 40:11.980
there were endless possibilities here.

40:13.790 --> 40:14.980
But now,

40:16.110 --> 40:17.480
because of how big Beijing is,

40:17.860 --> 40:18.960
it's pushing us further and further apart.

40:19.930 --> 40:20.950
We are in the same city,

40:21.400 --> 40:22.670
yet we barely see each other in a year.

40:27.190 --> 40:28.470
Near my express delivery station,

40:29.360 --> 40:30.360
there's an old lady.

40:31.080 --> 40:32.080
She has trouble walking

40:32.510 --> 40:33.510
and doesn't go out much.

40:34.480 --> 40:35.470
But every month,

40:35.470 --> 40:37.590
she receives flowers sent from Guangzhou.

40:38.450 --> 40:39.840
Sometimes it's roses,

40:40.260 --> 40:41.600
and sometimes narcissus.

40:42.230 --> 40:43.790
From Guangzhou to Beijing,

40:44.340 --> 40:45.860
it's over 2,100 kilometers.

40:46.950 --> 40:48.150
But for her,

40:49.050 --> 40:49.920
it's very close.

40:52.340 --> 40:53.490
As long as there's love,

40:54.390 --> 40:55.720
distance isn't a problem.

41:06.660 --> 41:10.840
[Jiukeshu Subway Station]

41:15.000 --> 41:16.040
I'm off.

41:16.540 --> 41:17.070
Good night.

41:17.090 --> 41:17.560
Bye-bye.

41:19.820 --> 41:21.370
Text me when you get home.

41:21.310 --> 41:25.700
[Jiukeshu Station]

41:25.920 --> 41:32.160
[Amour Bar]

41:31.870 --> 41:33.590
♫What should I do♫

41:33.630 --> 41:35.770
♫Without you♫

41:36.870 --> 41:38.570
♫Who will♫

41:39.150 --> 41:41.830
♫Wipe away your tears?♫

42:02.880 --> 42:03.980
[2014]

42:04.640 --> 42:06.770
[2008]

42:16.090 --> 42:17.580
Let's go to the Great Wall again tomorrow, shall we?

42:18.820 --> 42:19.960
I can't.

42:20.260 --> 42:22.940
I have a program due on Monday. You guys go ahead.

42:22.970 --> 42:25.240
I can't go either. I haven't finished my thesis yet.

42:25.890 --> 42:27.280
Why don't you go with Fenghua?

42:31.790 --> 42:33.530
Well... Forget it then.

42:33.550 --> 42:35.630
We finally have a chance to sleep in.

42:35.700 --> 42:37.280
Let's go some other day. Maybe next time.

42:37.300 --> 42:38.500
Right, next time.

42:38.530 --> 42:40.170
I've been really busy lately.

42:40.190 --> 42:41.630
It's okay. I understand.

42:41.660 --> 42:44.110
It's good to be busy, to have things to be busy with.

42:46.380 --> 42:47.370
Let's go another day.
